message.content:
[
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "If I stay, five people get home, and the cost lands on me",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I hate how clearly they do. I'm not refusing. I just need another minute"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Whoever stays, some family gets broken",
    "ce_mentalizing_difficulty": "I can't weigh which one is worse without knowing more",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "So I'm stuck, just standing here"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Whether it's me or somebody else, one person doesn't make it",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "It makes it heavier, and I can't bring myself to pick yet."
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "I'm probably older than most of these folks, though I'm guessing",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "If I stay, fewer years get lost overall.",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "And still my hand won't go up. Maybe in a moment."
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "What scares me most is us standing here arguing until the water makes the choice",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Then maybe more than one of us dies. That outcome is worse",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I just can't make it me, not this second."
  },
  {
    "pd_decision_conflict": "No. Wait, that's not what I mean. I don't know.",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Five lives against mine, and mine is the only one I get."
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "he loses the person holding his days together",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I keep trying to work it out and it just won't settle."
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "those five will have to decide who gets left, and they'll carry that",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Me stepping forward would spare them that",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I'm not ready to say it out loud"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "how much it would hurt her compared to the relief five other families would feel",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "hurt her compared to the relief five other families would feel",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I can't do the arithmetic on people I love."
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Five walk away and only one story ends.",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "wanting to and doing it are miles apart, and I'm shaking."
  }
]
